Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 00:54:12 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/22] add per-module GPU targets

- Limit modules to requested supported targets
- Keep codegen and compile targets thread-local
- Reject unsupported direct JIT module requests

Tools used:
- GPT: 5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
